            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003E\u0026#127881; Have you heard about the Umbraco Spark Diversity programme? We\u0026#39;re offering FREE tickets to ensure everyone can attend the conference, regardless of background, gender, race, or experience. \u0026#128073; Apply or nominate today: https://shorturl.at/YHwkj for a chance to receive a free ticket. Let\u0026#39;s build a tech community where everyone is included. \u0026#127775;  #umbracospark #diversityintech #umbraco\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https://umbracocommunity.social/@umbracospark/115570588919411719\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022 rel=\u0022noopener\u0022\u003ERead the original article\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/p\u003E"
